  "next_id": 57,
  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -21,
        -16
      ],
      "id": 56,
      "text": "Logic chips in DIP packages (SN-222): a 74HC14 Schmitt inverter with 470 kOhm and 1 uF oscillates at about 2.4 Hz and clocks a CD4017.\nQ5 is wired to MR, so the counter returns to Q0 after Q4: five LEDs light in turn. Both chips need their supply pins wired, as on a breadboard."
    }
  ],
